  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash beyond the reset: Transforming humanitarian 
assistance to be more cost-effective, accountable, and people-centred</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will amplify the UK&#x2019;s efforts to drive a scale up of cash assistance as a proportion of international humanitarian assistance, and through doing so enable reform priorities on cost efficiency, people centered and locally led response.</narrative>
  </description>
